{
  "uid": "lab3-split-vs-record",
  "title": "Lab 3: Split vs Record",
  "tags": [
    "nifi",
    "lab"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 5,
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Lab 3: Split vs Record.** Group **A - Split-based** vs **B - Record-based**.\n\n* NiFi reports most component values for a **rolling 5-minute window**: after a run the lines stay up for ~5 min, then drop to 0.\n* Prometheus scrapes every **15 s**: short spikes (B finishes in under a second) can fall between scrapes.\n* For a visible difference run each variant separately with a bigger `Number of Records` (100 000+). Exact per-run numbers: `make lab03-measure`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Task time, last 5 min",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "nifi_total_task_duration{component_type=\"ProcessGroup\", component_name=~\"[AB] - .*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{component_name}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "FlowFiles In, all processors",
      "description": "Sum of FlowFiles In over all processors of the group, as reported by NiFi.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (group) (nifi_amount_items_input{component_type=\"Processor\"} * on(parent_id) group_left(group) label_replace(label_replace(0 * nifi_amount_items_queued{component_type=\"ProcessGroup\", component_name=~\"[AB] - .*\"} + 1, \"parent_id\", \"$1\", \"component_id\", \"(.*)\"), \"group\", \"$1\", \"component_name\", \"(.*)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{group}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
